Package: discord-music-bot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: alonHamb <48965210+alonHamb@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, ffmpeg, curl, unzip, ca-certificates, systemd
Description: Discord music bot (YouTube, SoundCloud, Spotify, Apple Music)
 Plays music in Discord voice channels from YouTube and SoundCloud, and from
 Spotify and Apple Music links (matched to YouTube). Queue, loop, shuffle and
 saved playlists. Runs as the discord-music-bot systemd service.
 .
 After installing, set the bot token with: sudo discord-music-bot token
 Installation downloads the Python packages and Deno, so it needs internet.
